---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home Technology Help Ivanhoe & Eaglemont
description: Straightforward in-home technology help for Ivanhoe and Eaglemont, including Wi-Fi, slow computers, printers, personal email, scam concerns and Windows setup.
---

{% macro jsonValue(value) -%}
{{ value | dump | replace('<', '\\u003c') | replace('>', '\\u003e') | replace('&', '\\u0026') | safe }}
{%- endmacro %}

<header class="relative overflow-hidden pb-16 pt-28 md:pb-20 md:pt-32 lg:pb-24 lg:pt-40">
    <div class="container mx-auto grid items-center gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
        <div class="z-10 order-2 text-center lg:order-1 lg:text-left">
            <p class="mb-5 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent-ink">Home tech support · Ivanhoe &amp; Eaglemont</p>
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl">
                We turn <span class="text-accent-ink lg:block">things on.</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75 lg:mx-0 lg:text-xl">
                Straightforward in-home help for weak Wi-Fi, slow computers, malware concerns, backups, phone and tablet moves, printers, personal email, scams and everyday technology.
            </p>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl font-semibold text-ink lg:mx-0">Clear scope. Fixed prices. No mysterious jargon.</p>
            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row lg:justify-start">
                <a href="#find-help" class="inline-flex min-h-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-inverse px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-inverse-ink shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-black">
                    Find the right help
                </a>
                <a href="{{ site.phone.href }}" class="inline-flex min-h-14 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-ivanhoe-slate px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-ink transition hover:bg-inverse hover:text-white" aria-label="Call Naked Tech on {{ site.phone.display }}">
                    <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"></path></svg>
                    {{ site.phone.display }}
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group relative order-1 lg:order-2">
            <div class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-3xl bg-accent opacity-20 blur transition duration-700 group-hover:opacity-35" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <img
                src="/img/nakedtech_hero_technician.webp"
                alt="Naked Tech technician helping with a laptop in a bright home"
                width="1408"
                height="768"
                class="relative h-64 w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-2xl sm:h-80 lg:h-[500px]"
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<section id="find-help" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-surface py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="find-help-heading">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent-ink">Start with the problem</p>
            <h2 id="find-help-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">What’s giving you grief?</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Describe what is happening or choose the closest match. Each published assessment has a clear purpose, scope and practical next step.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl rounded-3xl border border-line bg-canvas p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-5" data-pagefind-ignore>
            <p class="text-left text-sm font-bold">Describe the problem in your own words</p>
            <button type="button" class="mt-2 flex min-h-14 w-full cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-line bg-surface px-4 py-3 text-left text-base text-muted transition hover:border-accent hover:text-ink" data-site-search-trigger data-site-search-source="homepage" aria-label="Search Naked Tech from the homepage" hidden>
                <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m21 21-4.35-4.35m1.35-5.65a7 7 0 1 1-14 0 7 7 0 0 1 14 0Z"></path></svg>
                <span class="min-w-0 flex-grow truncate" data-site-search-home-value data-placeholder="Try “my computer might have a virus”">Try “my computer might have a virus”</span>
                <span class="hidden rounded-full bg-inverse px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-inverse-ink sm:inline">Search</span>
            </button>
            <noscript><a href="/services/" class="mt-2 flex min-h-14 w-full items-center rounded-2xl border-2 border-line bg-surface px-4 py-3 font-bold text-ink">Browse services and pricing</a></noscript>
            <p class="mt-3 text-left text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Search words stay in this browser. If Analytics is already enabled, Naked Tech may count only a predefined service-interest category—never what you typed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-6xl gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-6">
            {% for problemService in problemServices %}
            <a href="{{ problemService.path }}" class="group flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border border-line bg-canvas p-7 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/60 hover:shadow-xl lg:col-span-2{% if loop.last %} lg:col-start-3{% endif %}">
                <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent/20 text-accent-ink" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="{{ problemService.iconPath }}"></path></svg>
                </span>
                <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-accent-ink">{{ problemService.price }}</p>
                <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold">{{ problemService.title }}</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 flex-grow leading-relaxed text-ink/65">{{ problemService.description }}</p>
                <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center font-bold text-ink group-hover:text-accent-ink">{{ problemService.cta }} <span class="ml-2 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            </a>
            {% endfor %}

            <a href="/services/" class="group rounded-3xl bg-inverse p-7 text-inverse-ink shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-black hover:shadow-2xl md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-6 lg:flex lg:items-center lg:gap-7">
                <span class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent text-ivanhoe-slate" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6v6l4 2m5-2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                </span>
                <div class="mt-6 flex-grow lg:mt-0">
                    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">Not sure where to start?</p>
                    <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold">Something else</h3>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/70">Smart-home equipment, home offices and other everyday technology problems are welcome too.</p>
                </div>
                <span class="mt-6 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center font-bold text-inverse-ink group-hover:text-accent lg:mt-0">See all services <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <aside class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-6xl rounded-2xl border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-6 py-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/75 md:flex md:items-start md:gap-5" aria-label="Urgent scam guidance">
            <p class="shrink-0 font-extrabold text-ink">Money may still be at risk?</p>
            <p class="mt-1 md:mt-0">Contact your bank immediately using the official number from its website, app or card. Do not wait for a Naked Tech appointment.</p>
        </aside>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
            <div class="max-w-3xl">
                <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent-ink">Projects and everyday support</p>
                <h2 id="projects-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Need a bigger setup?</h2>
                <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Explore complete home technology projects, or book practical help with the smaller things.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/services/" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center font-bold text-ink hover:text-accent-ink hover:underline">Compare all services &amp; pricing <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
            {% for service in services %}
            <article class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-7 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
                <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-canvas text-accent-ink" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="{{ service.iconPath }}"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-accent-ink">{{ service.name }}</p>
                <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold">{{ service.category }}</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 flex-grow leading-relaxed text-ink/65">{{ service.cardDescription }}</p>
                <div class="mt-6 border-t border-line pt-5">
                    <p class="text-lg font-extrabold">{{ service.typicalInvestment }}</p>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink/60">{{ service.priceLine }}</p>
                </div>
                <a href="/services/{{ service.slug }}/" class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-ink hover:text-accent-ink hover:underline">
                    View this service <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                </a>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="how-it-works" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-inverse py-16 text-inverse-ink md:py-24" aria-labelledby="how-it-works-heading">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">What happens next</p>
            <h2 id="how-it-works-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Help without the runaround.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-6xl gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
            <li class="border-t border-skin-bone/20 pt-6">
                <span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-accent">01</span>
                <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">Choose the closest problem</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/70">Book the relevant assessment or tell us what is happening if you are not sure where it fits.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="border-t border-skin-bone/20 pt-6">
                <span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-accent">02</span>
                <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">Agree on the scope</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/70">We confirm what the visit covers, the price and what may need a separate quote before work expands.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="border-t border-skin-bone/20 pt-6">
                <span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-accent">03</span>
                <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">Understand the next step</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/70">You get plain-English guidance on what was done, what still matters and what is worth doing next.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-surface py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
    <div class="container mx-auto grid gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:items-start">
        <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent-ink">Why Naked Tech</p>
            <h2 id="why-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Straight answers. Local help.</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">The personality is playful. The advice, scope and pricing are taken seriously.</p>
            <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Naked Tech is operated by Peter Reginald, ABN 57 221 340 918, a sole trader based in Ivanhoe and also trading as Digital Sanctum. In-home appointments are available in Ivanhoe and Eaglemont from Monday to Friday, 9am–5pm.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <article class="rounded-2xl bg-canvas p-6">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">30+ years in technology and support</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Peter brings decades of experience to practical decisions about home technology.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-2xl bg-canvas p-6">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Fixed prices and agreed quotes</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Published assessments are fixed-price, while larger projects are scoped before work begins.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-2xl bg-canvas p-6">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Hardware sold at cost</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Where a project includes recommended equipment, the advice is not shaped by a hardware margin.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-2xl bg-canvas p-6">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Ivanhoe &amp; Eaglemont</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">A deliberately local in-home service area with local call-out included in published assessments.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "@id": {{ jsonValue(site.url ~ '/#website') }},
      "url": {{ jsonValue(site.url ~ '/') }},
      "name": {{ jsonValue(site.name) }},
      "alternateName": ["nakedtech.au"],
      "inLanguage": "en-AU",
      "publisher": {
        "@id": {{ jsonValue(site.url ~ '/#business') }}
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "@id": {{ jsonValue(site.url ~ '/#business') }},
      "name": {{ jsonValue(site.name) }},
      "legalName": {{ jsonValue(site.operator.name) }},
      "url": {{ jsonValue(site.url ~ '/') }},
      "description": {{ jsonValue(description) }},
      "telephone": {{ jsonValue(site.phone.schema) }},
      "taxID": {{ jsonValue(site.operator.abn) }},
      "logo": {
        "@type": "ImageObject",
        "url": {{ jsonValue(site.url ~ site.logo.path) }},
        "contentUrl": {{ jsonValue(site.url ~ site.logo.path) }},
        "width": {{ site.logo.width }},
        "height": {{ site.logo.height }}
      },
      "address": {
        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "addressLocality": {{ jsonValue(site.location.locality) }},
        "addressRegion": {{ jsonValue(site.location.region) }},
        "postalCode": {{ jsonValue(site.location.postalCode) }},
        "addressCountry": {{ jsonValue(site.location.country) }}
      },
      "areaServed": [
        {% for area in site.serviceAreas %}{
          "@type": "Place",
          "name": {{ jsonValue(area) }}
        }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      ],
      "openingHoursSpecification": {
        "@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification",
        "dayOfWeek": [
          "Monday",
          "Tuesday",
          "Wednesday",
          "Thursday",
          "Friday"
        ],
        "opens": {{ jsonValue(site.hours.opens) }},
        "closes": {{ jsonValue(site.hours.closes) }}
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<section class="bg-accent py-14 text-ivanhoe-slate md:py-20" aria-labelledby="home-cta-heading">
    <div class="container mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col gap-8 px-6 text-center md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:text-left">
        <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em]">Ready when you are</p>
            <h2 id="home-cta-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Let’s get you unstuck.</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-ivanhoe-slate/75">Tell us what is happening—without the jargon.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex min-h-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-inverse px-8 py-4 font-bold text-white transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-black">Book a visit</a>
            <a href="{{ site.phone.href }}" class="inline-flex min-h-14 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border-2 border-ivanhoe-slate px-8 py-4 font-bold transition hover:bg-inverse hover:text-white">{{ site.phone.display }}</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
